cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the manuscript, study protocol, and exact repository commit used."
title: "Feature Augmentation for Forecasting with Reconstruction-Based Representations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Mohit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/Kernel_Affine_Hull_Koopman_Machine"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and numerical evidence for forecasting with normalized reconstruction
  affinities and additional normalization or local-coordinate features.
  Experiments compare KAHM, affine and kernel-weighted averaging reconstruction
  methods with raw-history predictors. Related studies assess predictor
  capacity, residual forecasting and model selection. Information preservation,
  fitted prediction accuracy and autonomous state evolution are separate
  scientific questions.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - geometric representations
  - kernel methods
  - reproducibility
